## What you gain vs cost

| | MobileNetV3-Small (current) | EfficientNet-B0 |
|---|---|---|
| Parameters | 2.5M | 5.3M |
| Inference speed | ~80ms CPU | ~130ms CPU |
| ONNX size | ~6MB | ~16MB |
| Accuracy on hard cases | baseline | +2-4% F1 expected |
| Extra GPU time in Kaggle | — | +20-30 min |

The inference speed hit from 80ms to 130ms is real but acceptable — your `/predict` endpoint is well within user tolerance at 130ms, and `/explain` (GradCAM) already takes 300-500ms so EfficientNet barely changes the experience for that endpoint.

